WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The Oracle resistance includes viscous damping and a smooth Coulomb-like term. These curves are evaluator diagnostics.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Keep both fitted models frozen. Prepare the held-out position-error axes, then draw the zero reference and each residual.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Both residuals are now visible: orange remains structured; blue is near zero. Compare the held-out position RMSE.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Dashed lines now mark true velocity reversals. The friction model improves this prediction; a residual pattern alone does not prove friction.
